        ['id'=>10187,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>1650,'title'=>'Unemployment in historic Hits dramatic Year High as Manufacturing Contracts','exc'=>'The structural problems identified in the report had been visible for years, analysts noted, adding that short-term policy responses had repeatedly deferred rather than resolved the underlying tensions.','body'=>'<p>The situation developed with a speed that left observers struggling to keep pace, as each new development built on the last in ways that underscored the interconnected nature of the forces at work.</p><p>Those with deep expertise in the area described it as a confluence of trends that had each been building independently for years before arriving simultaneously at a point of acute pressure.</p><p>The institutional response was measured, with officials taking care to frame their position in a way that acknowledged the complexity without appearing to minimise the significance of what was unfolding.</p><p>What comes next remains genuinely uncertain, though the structural conditions that produced the current moment show no sign of resolving themselves quickly or easily.</p>','cat'=>'Business','author'=>'Michael Adebayo','img'=>'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611974789855-9c2a0a7236a3?w=800&q=80','tags'=>['Inflation','Rates','Economy'],'date'=>'2023-11-22 09:06:00'],
