        ['id'=>10487,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>2623,'title'=>'126% of New Car Sales in historic Now Electric, Ahead of Target','exc'=>'The milestone was described by advocates as the clearest signal yet that the transition away from internal combustion engines had reached a point of no return in the country\'s new vehicle market.','body'=>'<p>The situation developed with a speed that left observers struggling to keep pace, as each new development built on the last in ways that underscored the interconnected nature of the forces at work.</p><p>Those with deep expertise in the area described it as a confluence of trends that had each been building independently for years before arriving simultaneously at a point of acute pressure.</p><p>The institutional response was measured, with officials taking care to frame their position in a way that acknowledged the complexity without appearing to minimise the significance of what was unfolding.</p><p>What comes next remains genuinely uncertain, though the structural conditions that produced the current moment show no sign of resolving themselves quickly or easily.</p>','cat'=>'Technology','author'=>'Jason Liu','img'=>'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1550751827-4bd374c3f58b?w=800&q=80','tags'=>['EV','Tesla','Battery'],'date'=>'2025-03-07 11:11:00'],
