        ['id'=>10489,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>2707,'title'=>'X Under Musk: Advertiser Return Disappoints as Revenue Stays 19% Below Peak','exc'=>'Advertisers said they were watching the content environment closely and that their decision to return or withdraw spending would be driven by brand safety assessments rather than by any personal view of the platform\'s ownership.','body'=>'<p>Few events arrive fully formed. The roots of this one stretched back further than most accounts acknowledged, through a series of decisions, deferred choices, and accumulated pressures that had been visible to specialists for years.</p><p>The immediate trigger was real enough, but veterans of the subject said it should be understood as the proximate rather than the underlying cause of a development that had, in retrospect, an air of inevitability.</p><p>Institutions moved to respond, though the speed and coherence of that response drew mixed assessments from outside observers who questioned whether the frameworks in place were suited to what they were now being asked to manage.</p><p>The longer-term significance will be debated for years, but the immediate effect was to reshape the landscape in ways that all parties involved will need to navigate carefully if the situation is to stabilise.</p>','cat'=>'Technology','author'=>'Erik Lindqvist','img'=>'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555949963-aa79dcee981c?w=800&q=80','tags'=>['Social Media','TikTok','Platform'],'date'=>'2025-08-25 15:49:00'],
        ['id'=>10490,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>2163,'title'=>'Generative AI Market Reaches critical Billion, Growing record-breaking% Year on Year','exc'=>'The regulatory framework established a risk-based taxonomy that legal experts said would require significant operational changes at organisations deploying AI in high-stakes contexts.','body'=>'<p>The announcement was received with a range of reactions that reflected genuinely different assessments of the evidence, the stakes, and the appropriate weight to give competing considerations.</p><p>Supporters argued that the decision represented a rational response to conditions that could not be indefinitely ignored, while critics maintained that the approach risked unintended consequences that had not been adequately modelled.</p><p>Both positions had merit, and the honest answer was that the situation involved real trade-offs between values and interests that did not admit of a perfect resolution — only better or worse choices among imperfect options.</p><p>The debate continued in the days that followed, with new information and perspectives adding detail to a picture that remained incomplete and in certain key respects contested.</p>','cat'=>'Technology','author'=>'Lena Fischer','img'=>'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518770660439-4636190af475?w=800&q=80','tags'=>['AI','OpenAI','Machine Learning'],'date'=>'2023-01-02 16:13:00'],
