        ['id'=>10509,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>937,'title'=>'EU Forces far-reaching to Open Interoperability Under Digital Markets Act','exc'=>'Advertisers said they were watching the content environment closely and that their decision to return or withdraw spending would be driven by brand safety assessments rather than by any personal view of the platform\'s ownership.','body'=>'<p>When the full account is eventually written, historians will note the particular quality of the moment: the sense among those living through it that something significant was happening, combined with an inability to be certain about precisely what it meant.</p><p>Contemporaries who tried to find precedents for comparison found them only partially useful, because while the surface resemblances were real, the underlying conditions were different enough to make analogies more misleading than illuminating.</p><p>What was not in doubt was that the event had accelerated timelines and concentrated minds in ways that incrementalism alone would not have achieved in the same period.</p><p>The challenge now was to convert that concentrated attention into durable commitments, a challenge that history suggested was substantially harder than the moments of acute focus that preceded it might imply.</p>','cat'=>'Technology','author'=>'Erik Lindqvist','img'=>'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555949963-aa79dcee981c?w=800&q=80','tags'=>['Creators','Influencer','Revenue'],'date'=>'2024-10-07 15:22:00'],
        ['id'=>10510,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>2039,'title'=>'AI Agent Completes far-reaching Hour Work Task Autonomously in far-reaching Minutes','exc'=>'The regulatory framework established a risk-based taxonomy that legal experts said would require significant operational changes at organisations deploying AI in high-stakes contexts.','body'=>'<p>The situation developed with a speed that left observers struggling to keep pace, as each new development built on the last in ways that underscored the interconnected nature of the forces at work.</p><p>Those with deep expertise in the area described it as a confluence of trends that had each been building independently for years before arriving simultaneously at a point of acute pressure.</p><p>The institutional response was measured, with officials taking care to frame their position in a way that acknowledged the complexity without appearing to minimise the significance of what was unfolding.</p><p>What comes next remains genuinely uncertain, though the structural conditions that produced the current moment show no sign of resolving themselves quickly or easily.</p>','cat'=>'Technology','author'=>'Lena Fischer','img'=>'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518770660439-4636190af475?w=800&q=80','tags'=>['Investment','Startup','Chips'],'date'=>'2025-09-16 21:38:00'],
