        ['id'=>10629,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>1804,'title'=>'TikTok Ban Legislation Passes four Congress, Platform Given thirty Days to Divest','exc'=>'The regulatory intervention was the most significant application to date of the new framework and was being watched closely by other large platforms as a guide to what compliance would actually require in practice.','body'=>'<p>The situation developed with a speed that left observers struggling to keep pace, as each new development built on the last in ways that underscored the interconnected nature of the forces at work.</p><p>Those with deep expertise in the area described it as a confluence of trends that had each been building independently for years before arriving simultaneously at a point of acute pressure.</p><p>The institutional response was measured, with officials taking care to frame their position in a way that acknowledged the complexity without appearing to minimise the significance of what was unfolding.</p><p>What comes next remains genuinely uncertain, though the structural conditions that produced the current moment show no sign of resolving themselves quickly or easily.</p>','cat'=>'Technology','author'=>'Erik Lindqvist','img'=>'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555949963-aa79dcee981c?w=800&q=80','tags'=>['Social Media','TikTok','Platform'],'date'=>'2024-09-09 13:04:00'],
