        ['id'=>10808,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>true,'views'=>2804,'title'=>'China Completes Lunar Base Framework, Plans Crewed Mission by serious','exc'=>'Mission controllers described the moment as one that validated years of iteration, failure, and redesign, saying it opened the door to a cadence of flights that would have seemed implausible just years before.','body'=>'<p>Few events arrive fully formed. The roots of this one stretched back further than most accounts acknowledged, through a series of decisions, deferred choices, and accumulated pressures that had been visible to specialists for years.</p><p>The immediate trigger was real enough, but veterans of the subject said it should be understood as the proximate rather than the underlying cause of a development that had, in retrospect, an air of inevitability.</p><p>Institutions moved to respond, though the speed and coherence of that response drew mixed assessments from outside observers who questioned whether the frameworks in place were suited to what they were now being asked to manage.</p><p>The longer-term significance will be debated for years, but the immediate effect was to reshape the landscape in ways that all parties involved will need to navigate carefully if the situation is to stabilise.</p>','cat'=>'Technology','author'=>'Priya Desai','img'=>'','tags'=>['Satellite','Starlink','Internet'],'date'=>'2023-06-27 21:55:00'],
