        ['id'=>10827,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>2882,'title'=>'Aviation: First Commercial a hundred and fifty Passenger Electric Flight Completed','exc'=>'Industry analysts said the price reduction was a calculated bet on volume over margin, one that would work only if demand elasticity proved as high as the company\'s internal modelling suggested.','body'=>'<p>Numbers can capture the scale of what occurred but not its texture. Behind the figures were individual stories that defied easy summary and that the official account, necessarily schematic, was unable to convey.</p><p>Researchers who had spent years tracking the subject described a mix of vindication and alarm at how events had unfolded, saying the data had long pointed in this direction but that the pace was faster than even pessimistic scenarios had suggested.</p><p>The policy response drew criticism from those who argued it was too slow, too limited, and too deferential to interests that had contributed to the situation rather than helping to prevent it.</p><p>Future analysis will inevitably focus on the decisions not taken in the years before, and on whether different choices at key junctures would have led to materially different outcomes.</p>','cat'=>'Technology','author'=>'Jason Liu','img'=>'','tags'=>['Autonomous','Self-Driving','Transport'],'date'=>'2024-12-11 06:46:00'],
        ['id'=>10828,'published'=>true,'featured'=>true,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>350,'title'=>'Rocket Lab Launches forty Consecutive Missions Without Failure','exc'=>'Mission controllers described the moment as one that validated years of iteration, failure, and redesign, saying it opened the door to a cadence of flights that would have seemed implausible just years before.','body'=>'<p>Few events arrive fully formed. The roots of this one stretched back further than most accounts acknowledged, through a series of decisions, deferred choices, and accumulated pressures that had been visible to specialists for years.</p><p>The immediate trigger was real enough, but veterans of the subject said it should be understood as the proximate rather than the underlying cause of a development that had, in retrospect, an air of inevitability.</p><p>Institutions moved to respond, though the speed and coherence of that response drew mixed assessments from outside observers who questioned whether the frameworks in place were suited to what they were now being asked to manage.</p><p>The longer-term significance will be debated for years, but the immediate effect was to reshape the landscape in ways that all parties involved will need to navigate carefully if the situation is to stabilise.</p>','cat'=>'Technology','author'=>'Priya Desai','img'=>'','tags'=>['NASA','Moon','Artemis'],'date'=>'2024-10-04 08:41:00'],
        ['id'=>10829,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>1838,'title'=>'Platform Liability Ruling Changes Content Moderation Rules in serious','exc'=>'Platform executives described the policy change as a carefully balanced measure, while critics argued it prioritised engagement metrics over user wellbeing in ways that the internal research had long flagged.','body'=>'<p>Numbers can capture the scale of what occurred but not its texture. Behind the figures were individual stories that defied easy summary and that the official account, necessarily schematic, was unable to convey.</p><p>Researchers who had spent years tracking the subject described a mix of vindication and alarm at how events had unfolded, saying the data had long pointed in this direction but that the pace was faster than even pessimistic scenarios had suggested.</p><p>The policy response drew criticism from those who argued it was too slow, too limited, and too deferential to interests that had contributed to the situation rather than helping to prevent it.</p><p>Future analysis will inevitably focus on the decisions not taken in the years before, and on whether different choices at key junctures would have led to materially different outcomes.</p>','cat'=>'Technology','author'=>'Erik Lindqvist','img'=>'','tags'=>['Algorithm','Content','Moderation'],'date'=>'2025-05-07 06:01:00'],
        ['id'=>10830,'published'=>true,'featured'=>true,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>3790,'title'=>'GLP-1 Drug Ozempic Changes Obesity Treatment for 337 Million Patients','exc'=>'Clinicians welcomed the data as the most compelling evidence yet that the intervention merited wider adoption, while health systems braced for the cost implications of prescribing at scale.','body'=>'<p>The situation developed with a speed that left observers struggling to keep pace, as each new development built on the last in ways that underscored the interconnected nature of the forces at work.</p><p>Those with deep expertise in the area described it as a confluence of trends that had each been building independently for years before arriving simultaneously at a point of acute pressure.</p><p>The institutional response was measured, with officials taking care to frame their position in a way that acknowledged the complexity without appearing to minimise the significance of what was unfolding.</p><p>What comes next remains genuinely uncertain, though the structural conditions that produced the current moment show no sign of resolving themselves quickly or easily.</p>','cat'=>'Lifestyle','author'=>'Isabella Rossi','img'=>'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1545205597-3d9d02c29597?w=800&q=80','tags'=>['Health','Wellness','Obesity'],'date'=>'2022-09-22 09:34:00'],
