        ['id'=>10938,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>1007,'title'=>'Quiet Quitting Replaced by Quiet Thriving in unexpected Workplace Trend','exc'=>'The trial data showed that the gains in reported wellbeing were sustained at three and six months, addressing the concern of sceptics who had predicted that any honeymoon effect would quickly fade.','body'=>'<p>Numbers can capture the scale of what occurred but not its texture. Behind the figures were individual stories that defied easy summary and that the official account, necessarily schematic, was unable to convey.</p><p>Researchers who had spent years tracking the subject described a mix of vindication and alarm at how events had unfolded, saying the data had long pointed in this direction but that the pace was faster than even pessimistic scenarios had suggested.</p><p>The policy response drew criticism from those who argued it was too slow, too limited, and too deferential to interests that had contributed to the situation rather than helping to prevent it.</p><p>Future analysis will inevitably focus on the decisions not taken in the years before, and on whether different choices at key junctures would have led to materially different outcomes.</p>','cat'=>'Lifestyle','author'=>'Hana Kimura','img'=>'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512621776951-a57141f6eedf?w=800&q=80','tags'=>['Four Day Week','Flexible','HR'],'date'=>'2024-08-13 21:17:00'],
        ['id'=>10939,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>3022,'title'=>'BNPL Debt Traps thirty Thousand in Spiral of Revolving Credit','exc'=>'Housing analysts said the correction reflected a normalisation of prices that had reached levels disconnected from incomes during the low interest rate era, and that the adjustment had further to run.','body'=>'<p>The situation developed with a speed that left observers struggling to keep pace, as each new development built on the last in ways that underscored the interconnected nature of the forces at work.</p><p>Those with deep expertise in the area described it as a confluence of trends that had each been building independently for years before arriving simultaneously at a point of acute pressure.</p><p>The institutional response was measured, with officials taking care to frame their position in a way that acknowledged the complexity without appearing to minimise the significance of what was unfolding.</p><p>What comes next remains genuinely uncertain, though the structural conditions that produced the current moment show no sign of resolving themselves quickly or easily.</p>','cat'=>'Lifestyle','author'=>'Felix Boateng','img'=>'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544367577-be93eca3f35e?w=800&q=80','tags'=>['Credit','Spending','Cost of Living'],'date'=>'2025-05-06 09:45:00'],
