        ['id'=>11009,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>4610,'title'=>'Financial Influencer major Faces Fraud Charges After Clients Lose Millions','exc'=>'The figures on retirement savings painted a picture of a generation that had prioritised current consumption over future security in ways that would have profound consequences for social support systems.','body'=>'<p>The situation developed with a speed that left observers struggling to keep pace, as each new development built on the last in ways that underscored the interconnected nature of the forces at work.</p><p>Those with deep expertise in the area described it as a confluence of trends that had each been building independently for years before arriving simultaneously at a point of acute pressure.</p><p>The institutional response was measured, with officials taking care to frame their position in a way that acknowledged the complexity without appearing to minimise the significance of what was unfolding.</p><p>What comes next remains genuinely uncertain, though the structural conditions that produced the current moment show no sign of resolving themselves quickly or easily.</p>','cat'=>'Lifestyle','author'=>'Felix Boateng','img'=>'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544367577-be93eca3f35e?w=800&q=80','tags'=>['Housing','Mortgage','Prices'],'date'=>'2023-11-28 06:13:00'],
