        ['id'=>11095,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>2053,'title'=>'Cold Water Therapy Trend Grows Despite Mixed Evidence Base','exc'=>'Patients described the impact in transformative terms, though some reported side effects not captured in the trial data, raising questions about whether the rollout had been preceded by adequate long-term safety monitoring.','body'=>'<p>When the full account is eventually written, historians will note the particular quality of the moment: the sense among those living through it that something significant was happening, combined with an inability to be certain about precisely what it meant.</p><p>Contemporaries who tried to find precedents for comparison found them only partially useful, because while the surface resemblances were real, the underlying conditions were different enough to make analogies more misleading than illuminating.</p><p>What was not in doubt was that the event had accelerated timelines and concentrated minds in ways that incrementalism alone would not have achieved in the same period.</p><p>The challenge now was to convert that concentrated attention into durable commitments, a challenge that history suggested was substantially harder than the moments of acute focus that preceded it might imply.</p>','cat'=>'Lifestyle','author'=>'Jake Morrison','img'=>'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1545205597-3d9d02c29597?w=800&q=80','tags'=>['Mental Health','Therapy','Wellbeing'],'date'=>'2025-10-25 13:52:00'],
        ['id'=>11096,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>3723,'title'=>'Fine Dining Comeback: Bookings Up far-reaching% Post-Pandemic at Premium End','exc'=>'Food security experts said that price volatility in key commodities was no longer an occasional disruption but a structural feature of a system under simultaneous pressure from climate, geopolitics, and energy costs.','body'=>'<p>Numbers can capture the scale of what occurred but not its texture. Behind the figures were individual stories that defied easy summary and that the official account, necessarily schematic, was unable to convey.</p><p>Researchers who had spent years tracking the subject described a mix of vindication and alarm at how events had unfolded, saying the data had long pointed in this direction but that the pace was faster than even pessimistic scenarios had suggested.</p><p>The policy response drew criticism from those who argued it was too slow, too limited, and too deferential to interests that had contributed to the situation rather than helping to prevent it.</p><p>Future analysis will inevitably focus on the decisions not taken in the years before, and on whether different choices at key junctures would have led to materially different outcomes.</p>','cat'=>'Lifestyle','author'=>'Aisha Patel','img'=>'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1484480974693-6ca0a78fb36b?w=800&q=80','tags'=>['Restaurant','Dining','Hospitality'],'date'=>'2025-06-23 18:48:00'],
