        ['id'=>11536,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>1048,'title'=>'Ben Stokes Leads Remarkable England Comeback in record-breaking Test at 373','exc'=>'Selectors faced difficult choices as player availability was complicated by the congested international schedule, a problem that cricket administrators had long debated without arriving at a durable solution.','body'=>'<p>When the full account is eventually written, historians will note the particular quality of the moment: the sense among those living through it that something significant was happening, combined with an inability to be certain about precisely what it meant.</p><p>Contemporaries who tried to find precedents for comparison found them only partially useful, because while the surface resemblances were real, the underlying conditions were different enough to make analogies more misleading than illuminating.</p><p>What was not in doubt was that the event had accelerated timelines and concentrated minds in ways that incrementalism alone would not have achieved in the same period.</p><p>The challenge now was to convert that concentrated attention into durable commitments, a challenge that history suggested was substantially harder than the moments of acute focus that preceded it might imply.</p>','cat'=>'Sports','author'=>'Patrick Durand','img'=>'','tags'=>['T20','Series','Women\'s Cricket'],'date'=>'2023-09-07 10:28:00'],
