        ['id'=>11562,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>4545,'title'=>'James Webb Finds Evidence of Water on seven Planet in Habitable Zone','exc'=>'Astronomers described the detection as the culmination of years of instrument development and said it opened a new window on the universe that had been theoretically accessible but practically closed until now.','body'=>'<p>The situation developed with a speed that left observers struggling to keep pace, as each new development built on the last in ways that underscored the interconnected nature of the forces at work.</p><p>Those with deep expertise in the area described it as a confluence of trends that had each been building independently for years before arriving simultaneously at a point of acute pressure.</p><p>The institutional response was measured, with officials taking care to frame their position in a way that acknowledged the complexity without appearing to minimise the significance of what was unfolding.</p><p>What comes next remains genuinely uncertain, though the structural conditions that produced the current moment show no sign of resolving themselves quickly or easily.</p>','cat'=>'Science','author'=>'Dr Leila Ahmadi','img'=>'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507413245164-6160d8298b31?w=800&q=80','tags'=>['Space','Webb','Astronomy'],'date'=>'2022-10-11 06:58:00'],
        ['id'=>11563,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>1738,'title'=>'New Alzheimer\'s Drug Slows Progression by 257% in Phase seven Trial','exc'=>'The trial results exceeded the expectations of the principal investigators, who said they had hoped for statistical significance but had not anticipated an effect size of this magnitude across all subgroups.','body'=>'<p>When the full account is eventually written, historians will note the particular quality of the moment: the sense among those living through it that something significant was happening, combined with an inability to be certain about precisely what it meant.</p><p>Contemporaries who tried to find precedents for comparison found them only partially useful, because while the surface resemblances were real, the underlying conditions were different enough to make analogies more misleading than illuminating.</p><p>What was not in doubt was that the event had accelerated timelines and concentrated minds in ways that incrementalism alone would not have achieved in the same period.</p><p>The challenge now was to convert that concentrated attention into durable commitments, a challenge that history suggested was substantially harder than the moments of acute focus that preceded it might imply.</p>','cat'=>'Science','author'=>'Dr Thomas Berg','img'=>'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1532094349884-543282300eed?w=800&q=80','tags'=>['Medicine','Cancer','Trial'],'date'=>'2022-10-02 07:33:00'],
