        ['id'=>11652,'published'=>true,'featured'=>false,'breaking'=>false,'views'=>839,'title'=>'James Webb Finds Evidence of Water on 292 Planet in Habitable Zone','exc'=>'Scientists involved in the analysis said the implications extended beyond the immediate finding, touching on fundamental questions about the distribution of life\'s chemical precursors across the cosmos.','body'=>'<p>The situation developed with a speed that left observers struggling to keep pace, as each new development built on the last in ways that underscored the interconnected nature of the forces at work.</p><p>Those with deep expertise in the area described it as a confluence of trends that had each been building independently for years before arriving simultaneously at a point of acute pressure.</p><p>The institutional response was measured, with officials taking care to frame their position in a way that acknowledged the complexity without appearing to minimise the significance of what was unfolding.</p><p>What comes next remains genuinely uncertain, though the structural conditions that produced the current moment show no sign of resolving themselves quickly or easily.</p>','cat'=>'Science','author'=>'Dr Yuki Sato','img'=>'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507413245164-6160d8298b31?w=800&q=80','tags'=>['Planet','Exoplanet','Life'],'date'=>'2022-12-04 20:56:00'],
